{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05741","headline":"同张少府和厍狄员外夏晚初霁南省寓直时兼充节度判官之作 · 寇坦","name":"同张少府和厍狄员外夏晚初霁南省寓直时兼充节度判官之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄绶归休日，仙郎复奏余。\n晏居当夏晚，寓直会晴初。\n露散星文发，云披水镜虚。\n高才推独唱，嘉会喜连茹。\n月色摇春闼，香烟霭暝庐。\n千门传夜警，万象照阶除。\n少孺嘉能赋，文强阅赐书。\n兼曹谋未展，入幕志方摅。\n爲奉灵台帛，恭先待漏车。\n贞标不可仰，空此乐樵渔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寇坦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05741.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05741","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}